          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Irreeni lafa si buusani, siifi ijoolle tantele, duuba d'akha kanke kana tokole woli irati inhambisani, waan atini guyya Waaqi d'ufe si baasu imbeenneefi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.19.44",
